THE JANUARY TIME FRAME, WE

00:16:07.032 --> 00:16:08.233
REQUEST THAT THE TECHNICAL

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:09.268
ADVISORY COMMITTEE, OTHERWISE

00:16:09.335 --> 00:16:11.303
