REVIEW AND COMMENT. ANY COMMENTS

00:16:23.215 --> 00:16:24.116
FROM BOARD MEMBERS IS THEN

00:16:24.183 --> 00:16:26.218
INCORPORATED INTO A FINAL DRAFT,

00:16:26.285 --> 00:16:27.386
WHICH IS ALSO RECIRCULATED BACK

00:16:27.453 --> 00:16:30.422
THROUGH THE TAC AND BOARD AGAIN

